  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.27\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.27 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.26\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.26 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.25\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.25 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.24\n- Renamed the shipped JavaScript module to fireForNet-auth-shared.js, matching the module name the browser package binds it to.\n- The module ships from a physical copy in this package's own wwwroot, instead of a link into the browser package. A linked copy resolved its content root to the linking project and 404ed at runtime.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.23\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.23 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.22\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.22 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.21\n- No functional changes; synchronized with the framework-free MAUI integration sweep.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.20\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.20 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.19\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.19 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.18\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.18 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.17\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.17 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.16\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.16 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.15\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.15 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.14\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.14 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.13\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.13 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.12\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.12 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.11\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.11 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.10\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.10 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.9\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.9 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.8\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.8 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.7\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.7 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.6\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.6 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.5\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.5 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.4\n- Migrated BlazorAuthInterop to lazy ES-module import via Lazy<Task<IJSObjectReference>> for thread-safe concurrent access\n- Added dual disposal (IDisposable + IAsyncDisposable) with JSDisconnectedException handling\n\nv1.0.1-preview.3\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.3 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.2\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.2 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.1\n- Synchronized package version with the preview10 release.\n\nv1.0.0-preview9\n- Initial release. Replaces FireForNet.Firebase.Auth.Blazor.WebAssembly.\n- IJSRuntime-based token storage (localStorage, sessionStorage), OAuth popup flow, and AuthenticationStateProvider for all Blazor hosting models (WASM, Server, Hybrid, Auto).\n- UseBlazor() extension method on FirebaseAuthBuilder for service registration.\n- No dependency on FireForNet.Firebase.Auth.Browser — references core Auth package directly.\n- JS modules are identical to the Browser package (shared ES module exports).",
